body:
Move sprite_fonts sprite 2 (InterfaceSprFonts: the magic dialog numeral strip and roman numerals, the HUD HP/MP digits, the old character labels) out of interface/sprite_fonts into its own folder. User, 2026-11-25: "Those aren't really sprite fonts - so yes it's fine to leave that - but it should probably move out of sprite fonts".

Today it loads with the others in screen_loading.cpp:127-131 (as of 2026-11-25). The move needs:
- a new sprite folder with its manifest (keeping the HH-0083 art scale and the refit rects);
- the loader line changed;
- sprite 2 in sprite_fonts left as an empty placeholder (sprites load by position; HH-0067 used the same pattern), or the remaining fonts renumbered;
- index.json regenerated.

Waits on HH-0083, which is replacing that sheet now.

**Done when:** the sheet loads from its own folder, the magic numerals and HUD digits draw as before, gen_sprite_index --check passes, and both builds are clean.
